  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="AI AGENT CALL&#xA;&#xA;Sends a request to the configured AI model (default: Claude via Anthropic API) and returns the raw text response.&#xA;&#xA;Configuration keys required in Config.json under AIConfig (flattened into Config dict as &quot;AIConfig.X&quot;):&#xA;  AIConfig.Endpoint     - API URL  (e.g. https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages)&#xA;  AIConfig.ModelName    - Model ID (e.g. claude-sonnet-4-6)&#xA;  AIConfig.MaxTokens   - Token limit (e.g. 1024)&#xA;  AIConfig.SystemPrompt - System instruction&#xA;  AIConfig.APIKeyAsset  - Name of the Orchestrator asset holding the API key&#xA;&#xA;The API key is read from Config (loaded from Orchestrator asset by InitAllSettings).&#xA;&#xA;To swap AI providers: update Endpoint, ModelName, and adjust the request body in &quot;Build AI Request Body&quot;." DisplayName="AI Agent Call" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="960,1950" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_AI">
